{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國型男玄彬與妻子孫藝珍去年在韓國年度影壇盛事《第46屆青龍電影頒獎禮》中稱帝封后，又同台捧走「人氣明星獎」，風頭一時無兩。</p><p>兩夫妻預計今日下午合體參加打手印儀式，為本月25日舉行的《第47屆青龍電影頒獎禮》造勢。</p><p>其他預計出席打手印儀式的影星</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.068760+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:18:53.054536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:18:53.054536+00:00","content_hash":"03360bb5ea1713da7b7fc00635602b0a0de33923f1823e5a64e411057aced5f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}